{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 90,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.372276306152344,
        205.302978515625,
        72.36227416992188
      ],
      "text": "10.5.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        76.02693176269531,
        398.98284912109375,
        89.51692962646484
      ],
      "text": "Value was placed on nasal prongs being easier to apply than catheters. Both prongs and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        89.02693176269531,
        399.0628356933594,
        102.51692962646484
      ],
      "text": "catheters are less expensive and require lower flow rates of oxygen than face-masks",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        102.02693176269531,
        399.0628662109375,
        115.51692962646484
      ],
      "text": "and head-boxes. They are, therefore, more appropriate in low-resource settings. Nasal",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        115.02693176269531,
        354.2528991699219,
        128.51693725585938
      ],
      "text": "prongs are more expensive than catheters, but can be washed and reused.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        138.57449340820312,
        311.7279052734375,
        151.76348876953125
      ],
      "text": "10.6\t Criteria for starting and stopping oxygen therapy",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        155.20008850097656,
        384.3828430175781,
        168.69009399414062
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Children with hypoxaemia should be closely monitored using pulse oximetry.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        170.60479736328125,
        272.92279052734375,
        184.52481079101562
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        186.86949157714844,
        399.0528869628906,
        200.3594970703125
      ],
      "text": "b)\tOxygen therapy should be discontinued when oxygen saturation remains stable",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        199.86949157714844,
        399.1414794921875,
        213.3594970703125
      ],
      "text": "above recommended levels of 90% (≤2500M above sea level) or 87% (> 2500M",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        212.86949157714844,
        380.99151611328125,
        226.3594970703125
      ],
      "text": "above sea level) for at least 15 minutes on room air in a clinically stable child.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        228.27410888671875,
        272.92279052734375,
        242.19412231445312
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        256.05731201171875,
        231.48292541503906,
        268.04730224609375
      ],
      "text": "10.6.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        271.71197509765625,
        399.1128845214844,
        285.2019958496094
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review [Tickell, 2010] could not identify any studies comparing",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        284.71197509765625,
        399.15283203125,
        298.2019958496094
      ],
      "text": "outcomes for different criteria of starting and stopping oxygen therapy. There is",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        297.71197509765625,
        399.1030578613281,
        311.2019958496094
      ],
      "text": "expert opinion that where pulse oximetry is available, a safe way to ensure that a",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        310.71197509765625,
        399.11285400390625,
        324.2019958496094
      ],
      "text": "child is no longer hypoxaemic is a trial off oxygen once they are stable. Maintaining",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        323.71197509765625,
        399.06298828125,
        337.2019958496094
      ],
      "text": "saturations above 90% on room air for 15 minutes has been used in clinical trials that",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        336.71197509765625,
        399.09283447265625,
        350.2019958496094
      ],
      "text": "employed hypoxaemia as an outcome. Studies that have implemented these criteria,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        349.71197509765625,
        399.0628967285156,
        363.2019958496094
      ],
      "text": "combined with improvements in the detection and treatment of hypoxaemia, have",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        362.71197509765625,
        399.0628356933594,
        376.2019958496094
      ],
      "text": "demonstrated a 35–50% reduction in pneumonia mortality (Duke, 2008; Enarson",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        375.71197509765625,
        81.48291778564453,
        389.2019958496094
      ],
      "text": "2009).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        388.71197509765625,
        399.1315612792969,
        402.2019958496094
      ],
      "text": "Where pulse oximetry is not available, then the only indication of recovery from",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        401.71197509765625,
        293.462890625,
        415.2019958496094
      ],
      "text": "hypoxaemia is the absence of clinical signs of hypoxaemia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        426.2304992675781,
        163.96287536621094,
        438.2204895019531
      ],
      "text": "10.6.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        441.8752136230469,
        88.77290344238281,
        454.01519775390625
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        454.88519287109375,
        399.102783203125,
        468.3752136230469
      ],
      "text": "Clear guidelines for when to start and stop oxygen therapy are important for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        467.88519287109375,
        278.88299560546875,
        481.3752136230469
      ],
      "text": "improving the detection and treatment of hypoxaemia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        492.40380859375,
        205.302978515625,
        504.393798828125
      ],
      "text": "10.6.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        508.05841064453125,
        396.8504943847656,
        521.5484008789062
      ],
      "text": "Pulse oximetry is a non-invasive method and the best method of detecting the pres­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        521.0584106445312,
        399.0627136230469,
        534.5484008789062
      ],
      "text": "ence or absence of hypoxaemia which is easily acceptable by patients. The technology",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        534.0584106445312,
        399.11279296875,
        547.5484008789062
      ],
      "text": "is affordable (oximetres range from US$ 35 for handheld devices to US$  4500 for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        547.0584106445312,
        399.13299560546875,
        560.5484008789062
      ],
      "text": "more sophisticated models), and numerous studies have shown it to be adaptable and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        560.0584106445312,
        205.15292358398438,
        573.5484008789062
      ],
      "text": "sustainable in low-resource settings.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.4739990234375,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.56500244140625,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "76",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}